  "description": "To confirm your attendance at the viewing, please contact us by email or telephone our office.\n\n2 Hollywood Mews, Mount Anville Road, Dublin 14\n\nA spacious detached two-bedroom mews with two private parking spaces and an additional guest parking bay, quietly positioned in a private courtyard just off Mount Anville Road.\n\nRussell Estate Agents are delighted to present 2 Hollywood Mews to the market. Tucked away in a small residential enclave of just three properties, this attractive detached mews offers generous accommodation, excellent privacy and a superb Dublin 14 location.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition, the property provides an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, downsizer,  or investor looking for a well-located home in one of south Dublin’s most established residential areas.\n\nThe accommodation is surprisingly spacious and well-proportioned throughout. The front door opens into a bright entrance hallway, leading to a large kitchen and a generous, comfortable living room. Upstairs are two exceptionally well-sized bedrooms, positioned on either side of the shower room. Both bedrooms are bright and airy and offer excellent storage.\n\nOne of the property’s particularly useful features is its parking provision. There are two dedicated parking spaces, together with an additional guest parking bay, providing excellent convenience for residents and visitors alike.\n\nLocation\n\nThe location is a major attraction. Hollywood Mews is situated just off Mount Anville Road, within easy reach of UCD, Goatstown, Mount Merrion, Donnybrook, Stillorgan and Dundrum.\n\nDespite its quiet and private setting, the property is close to a wide range of everyday amenities, schools, sporting facilities, parks and public transport.\n\nSchools & Education\n\nThe area is particularly well served by schools, with a strong selection of both primary and secondary options within easy reach.\n\nGaelscoil Laighean is located directly on Mount Anville Road, making it an especially convenient option for families seeking Irish-medium primary education.\n\nOther nearby primary schools include:\n\nMount Anville Primary School\nSt Laurence’s Boys’ National School\nOur Lady’s Grove Primary School\nScoil San Treasa, Mount Merrion\n\nFor secondary education, nearby options include:\n\nMount Anville Secondary School\nColáiste Íosagáin\nColáiste Eoin\nOatlands College\nSt Benildus College\nSt Kilian’s German School\n\nUniversity College Dublin is also within easy walking distance, with its extensive academic, sporting and recreational facilities close at hand.\n\nSport & Recreation\n\nFor those who enjoy sport and the outdoors, the area offers an unusually broad choice of facilities and clubs.\n\nDeerpark is within walking distance and provides extensive green space, walking routes and recreational facilities.\n\nLocal sporting options include Kilmacud Crokes GAA Club, St Olaf’s GAA Club, UCD Sport & Fitness, Donnybrook Lawn Tennis Club, Deerpark Tennis Club, Leopardstown Tennis Club, Milltown Golf Club and Elm Park Golf & Sports Club.\n\nThere are also numerous football, rugby, GAA, tennis, athletics and fitness facilities throughout the surrounding neighbourhoods.\n\nShopping, Dining & Amenities\n\nEveryday convenience is another significant benefit of the location.\n\nThe property is within easy reach of Donnybrook, Goatstown, Mount Merrion, Stillorgan, Blackrock and Dundrum, providing an extensive choice of supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, shops and other services. \n\nFrascati Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre are also readily accessible, offering a wide range of retail, dining, leisure and entertainment options. St Helens Hotel is located just minutes away.\n\nThe nearby villages of Donnybrook, Ranelagh and Stillorgan provide a good selection of independent cafés, restaurants and local businesses.\n\nTransport\n\nThe property is well served by public transport, with several Dublin Bus routes operating close by.\n\nThe 11 bus route is particularly convenient, with nearby stops serving Mount Anville Road and the surrounding area and providing connections towards Goatstown, Clonskeagh, Ranelagh and Dublin city centre.\n\nOther nearby services include the 47 and 116, with additional routes available along the N11 corridor.\n\nThe Luas Green Line is also within easy reach, with Dundrum and Kilmacud stations providing convenient connections towards Dundrum, Sandyford and Dublin city centre.\n\nThe property’s position also provides straightforward access to the N11 and M50, making commuting to other parts of Dublin and beyond convenient. Dublin Airport is readily accessible by both road and public transport.\n\nThe Property\n\n2 Hollywood Mews offers something that can be increasingly difficult to find in this part of Dublin: a detached home with generous accommodation, privacy and excellent parking, while being within walking distance of UCD and close to some of south Dublin’s most established schools and amenities.\n\nThe quiet courtyard setting provides a sense of privacy without sacrificing convenience, with shops, schools, sporting facilities, public transport and recreational amenities all close by.\n\nKey Features\nDetached two-bedroom mews\nPrivate courtyard setting\nTwo dedicated parking spaces\nAdditional guest parking bay\nSpacious kitchen\nGenerous living room\nTwo large bedrooms\nExcellent storage\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation\nTurnkey condition\nWalking distance to UCD\nGaelscoil Laighean on Mount Anville Road\nExcellent choice of primary and secondary schools nearby\nClose to Deerpark\nExcellent range of GAA, tennis, golf and sporting facilities\nConvenient Dublin Bus connections\nLuas Green Line within easy reach\nEasy access to N11 and M50\nClose to Donnybrook, Stillorgan, Blackrock and Dundrum\n\nViewing\n\n2 Hollywood Mews is a well-located and unusually spacious two-bedroom detached mews, offering privacy, generous accommodation and excellent parking in a quiet Dublin 14 setting.\n\nWith UCD, schools, transport links, sporting facilities, parks, shopping and dining all close by, this is a property that combines the convenience of an established south Dublin location with the privacy of a small residential courtyard.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.",
